Three things before the files: the logo diagnostic, the scope reframe, and where AI lands.

Logo not appearing

The template references {{ 'assets/logo.svg' | url }}, which resolves to docs/assets/logo.svg. Check:

bash
ls docs/assets/

If your file is elsewhere or named differently, either move it or change the three <img src=...> references in home.html. If it's there and still blank, view source and click the rendered src — a 404 means Zensical didn't copy it, which happens if docs/assets/ was created after the dev server started. Restart the server.

The logo

An isometric ingot — a tapered bar, three lit faces, a highlight along the top edge. Reads as metal at 16px and at 200px.

docs/assets/logo.svg

xml
