For the favicon, the same file works — the shape is bold enough at 16px. If the shadow muddies it, delete the <ellipse> for the favicon copy.

Scope and AI

The page now says platform for the whole HDL lifecycle, with verification shipping first — honest about what exists, clear about where it's going. AI gets its own section between the loop and the stats, positioned as infrastructure rather than a feature: agents use the same CLI as humans, every action is recorded, conventions live in the repo.

