Assumptions I made

Lifecycle badges — Verify is "Shipping," Prove is "Next," Synthesize and Implement are "Planned." Adjust as reality shifts; the is-live class drives the green badge and the bright top border.

The agent terminal shows --json output and an ingot issue create — both exist. The dma block and issue number are illustrative; swap for real output when you have a real block.

Tools strip includes Vivado and Libero because they're in scope, not because they're integrated. If that reads as a claim you'd rather not make yet, move them to the roadmap only.

The AI section links from the sixth feature card via #ingot-agents. It sits between the terminal and stats — far enough down to be substantive, not so far that it's buried.

One thing worth deciding: the footer still says "Silicon design and verification platform." With the broadened scope, "Silicon development platform for circuitware" is the more accurate line, and it matches the hero pill.
